  metadata below.
title: >-
  Machine-Learning: a production-shaped ML portfolio with a Persian
  retrieval-augmented QA assistant
authors:
  - family-names: Ranjbaran
    given-names: Abolfazl
    website: https://github.com/Abolfazlrwm
type: software
version: v2.11.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abolfazlrwm/Machine-Learning"
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - persian-nlp
  - hybrid-retrieval
  - fastapi
  - mlops
abstract: >-
  A portfolio of end-to-end ML systems — a Persian RAG assistant (hybrid
  BM25+dense retrieval with RRF, reranking, prompt-injection guardrails,
  semantic answer caching, real-time streaming), a stock-movement predictor
  and an SMS spam classifier — served behind one FastAPI application with
  Prometheus observability, tagged releases and CI/CD.
